--[[
    Blox Fruits — Extract v6
    Changes from v5:
      - Orbit center smoothed with lerp (fixes position desync)
      - Per-frame delta cap (prevents huge jumps)
      - Rubberband detection: auto-throttles orbit speed on server reset
      - Single-instance lock via getgenv()
      - Unload button to release lock
]]

